[{"id":"28661","date":"2026-10-20T13:40:25+00:00","text":"🗣 Ex Genk goalkeeper coach, Gilbert Roex on Mike Penders: \"He was still playing for Jong Genk in the second division when Chelsea's scouts became convinced.\" \"It was similar to Courtois. He had only spent one season in the first team when he won the title and was still only 18. Maybe Chelsea's video scouts have identified a player who could be worth much more in the future.\" \"One of the teachers recommended him to me. When I saw him, he had a great profile, he played well and he had a great mentality. But technically, he needed a lot of work.\" \"At that time, his feet were terrible because he was so tall. But he passed the trial for our under-14s when he was 13.\" \"In the beginning he struggled a lot, but he worked very hard. We did footwork for at least 20 minutes in every session with our goalkeepers.\"","image":"https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/JAn6YPC3a9L4AF9nFoZjEtzebEKFEMO7VK43XYmt5zBm2llKio4NXRH4udUATVZ_3eGK4sQ26mqubTK-IPx-OjrXol2WmTU9bsbcE89x6MR-bx4tEqUyvWb5SXiiDawtAZZp7S6ejw22mPee7yHaGuXRdImagwzu65ZhI2SuN333H2UM-8WyTDUcI4S8xLMOgzrEP0nDd9OalErEDd_xBFA--NqUFB4VD3KUg_fHAK_9YgW4-6xb6dX6dkIura_x89Ps3BQODyRdyhBIAw6ynVDbu1wvP-sdP2ABxYDFTyTg7opLZzdBwMbWbHBCXx-NtZWG75kJxxow3jTXqW2QKw.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"28660","date":"2026-10-20T11:41:53+00:00","text":"🚨 𝗕𝗥𝗘𝗔𝗞𝗜𝗡𝗚: Real Madrid want the 6 PL clubs that signed up to the European Super League to pay a share of the initial costs of the abandoned project. They believe Arsenal, Chelsea, Liverpool, Man City, Man Utd and Tottenham should still be liable for the setup costs. 🔗 The Athletic","image":"https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/u07VsNoHPzazrnVzfXcg2-5SvphDSD7XskXfAkHDDwU1hx_pUWbH9IWD-WVxDtJluh7xfHsN2NpdaS1lVQ8v0pDoua4ipTIdBjqxB3FNclEWWjbbL4UJjQr-gawNy6qA_n-PLipmmRa4jhyjV12xeZI2Yqd1BENWomi8yG0ma7VHH8etulGmqgAcdlim62RBamVJbw2VdQ6_eCFbRf_PDaEBFFPIr2VZrtuBSmGiJ0tnUg-8wBMnTdHkZD-sWS_zK2JQiD420RZjCmyUs2VaCrv7pbEPChiyzswZVqXx5pCSBof4kkuH2HMFfbcac32oMZH